<li>Eucharist, Bishop, Church: The Unity of the Church in the Divine Eucharist and the Bishop During the First Three Centuries (Brookline, MA: Holy Cross, 2001)</li>
<li>Communion &amp; Otherness: Further Studies in Personhood and the Church (London: T &amp; T Clark, 2007)</li>
